    "html": "<h1 data-chunk-id=\"ca69dd1f-9e93-49e2-b08a-77cebaeda0e3\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;border-bottom:3px solid #0d47a1;padding-bottom:6px\">Nebula Drift - Art Bible</h1>\n<p data-chunk-id=\"bb7917c3-816a-4de4-a902-96e346595351\" style=\"background-color:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #1565c0;padding:8px 10px;font-size:9pt;color:#37474f\">Vantage Nine Studios - internal - sub-document of the Nebula Drift GDD.</p>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"45c922d6-aee7-4f8d-b60b-6b5d48f9d2d0\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Silhouette rules</h2>\n<ul data-chunk-id=\"4ceb6c92-c83d-48d3-a9e9-b4afe61372b2\">\n<li>Every hazard must be identifiable as a black shape at 40 px.</li>\n<li>Traversable geometry is warm; lethal geometry is cold. No exceptions.</li>\n<li>Detail budget goes to edges, not surfaces.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"5569b2d7-5752-4d2e-8200-2c1cf6a99ef6\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Palette</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"ab160276-94cd-4e47-af37-cffbb77cfa60\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr>\n<th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Role</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Hex</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Used for</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Traversable</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">#E8A33D</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Ledges, grapple points, anything the player may touch</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Lethal</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">#3D6FE8</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Coolant, vacuum breaches, crushers</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Neutral hull</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">#37474F</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Everything else</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"82525126-917b-4e4b-9417-88f2c0eadd6e\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Concept art</h2>\n<p data-chunk-id=\"f7dd1947-5f16-402a-ad88-e7574e0f961a\">Reference boards live in this section. Each image is captioned with the\nsector it belongs to and the date it was approved.</p>",
